OL,3,GNEWSANew Council of Ministers revealed
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe Isle of Man's new Council of
OL,6,FMinisters has been announced, including
OL,7,Fthree political newcomers.
OL,9,FWith the majority of the House of Keys
OL,10,Felected in September first-time
OL,11,Fpoliticians, ministers without previous
OL,12,Fexperience, had been expected.
OL,14,FBut there are a number of experienced
OL,15,Fmembers that have not been appointed,
OL,16,Fincluding the former Chief Minister
OL,17,FAlfred Cannan.
OL,19,FChief Minister Chris Thomas said he had
OL,20,F"formed a team that will work together
OL,21,Fto get things done and deliver for the
OL,22,Fpeople of the Isle of Man".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
